ayer aluminum frame with an epoxy coating for enhanced strength and resistance to corrosion, guaranteeing a precise fit and an airtight seal within the motorcycle’s airbox. Eco-Friendly Solution: The washable filter reduces environmental impact by minimizing waste from disposable filters. Easy Installation: Comes with comprehensive instructions, designed as a direct replacement for the OEM filter (part number 1570250). Technical Specifications: Filter Type: Oiled Cotton Gauze Dimensions: 51 mm (inner diameter) x 90 mm (outer diameter) x 104 mm (height) Warranty: 2 years limited Weight: 0.26 kg Compatibility: Royal Enfield Meteor 350 (2021 and later) Royal Enfield Bullet 350 (2023 and later) Royal Enfield Classic Reborn 350 (2022 and later) Royal Enfield Hunter 350 (2022 and later) Experience the perfect blend of Italian engineering, environmental responsibility, and enhanced motorcycle performance with the BMC Air Filter FM01138 — the premium choice for Royal Enfield enthusiasts seeking reliable power and longevity.8f:T9b3,BMC Air Filter FM346/10 for Kawasaki Z800, Z750 \\u0026 Z1000 – High Performance Reusable Motorcycle Air Filter BMC Air Filter FM346/10 is a premium, high-performance motorcycle air filter designed specifically for selected Kawasaki Z-series motorcycles. Engineered in Italy using advanced racing technology, this reusable air filter significantly improves airflow, throttle response, and overall engine performance. Key Features Direct replacement for the stock air filter No cutting or modification required Designed and manufactured in Italy Long-lasting and high durability Perfect for street and performance riding Advanced Filtration Technology This BMC motorcycle air filter is constructed using multi-layered cotton gauze soaked in low-viscosity oil. The cotton layers are enclosed in an epoxy-coated alloy mesh that protects the filter from petrol fumes and oxidation caused by humidity, ensuring consistent filtration performance over time. Performance Benefits Higher airflow compared to OEM paper air filters Improved engine breathing and throttle response Enhanced horsepower and torque output Consistent performance in extreme riding conditions No ECU remapping or modifications required Reusable \\u0026 Eco-Friendly All BMC air filters come pre-oiled and ready to install. They are fully washable and reusable, making them a cost-effective and eco-friendly alternative to disposable paper filters. Simply clean and regenerate the filter using the official BMC Regeneration Kit. Upgrade Your Ride Today Maximize the efficiency of the air entering your engine to unleash maximum power. Keep your Kawasaki Z-series motorcycle breathing freely and performing at its peak with the BMC Air Filter FM346/10 – trusted by riders and racers worldwide. Vehicle Compatibility Kawasaki Z1000: 2003 – 2009 Kawasaki Z750: 2004 – 2012 Kawasaki Z750 R: 2011 – 2012 Kawasaki Z750 S: 2005 – 2006 Kawasaki Z800: 2013 – 2016 Why Choose BMC Air Filter FM346/10? BMC air filters are manufactured using an exclusive Full Moulding system, allowing the iconic red filter to be produced from a single mold without welded joints. This design ensures superior durability, prevents breakage, and guarantees perfect sealing inside the airbox. The high-quality rubber used by BMC offers long life, exceptional resistance, and optimal adhesion to the airbox shape, even under extreme riding conditions. Order now and experience superior performance, reliability, and Italian engineering excellence.90:Tb94,DNA Air Cover Stage 2 and Filter for Ducati Hypermotard 698 Mono (23-26) P-DU65HM24-S2-COMBO - High-Flow Race Air Filter Upgrade your Ducati Hypermotard 698 Mono (2023-2026) with the DNA Stage 2 Combo Air Filter \\u0026 Cover (P-DU65HM24-S2-COMBO), designed specifically for race use. This Stage 2 kit delivers extreme airflow improvements, high filtering efficiency, and spark-safe performance for highly tuned engines. With its advanced FCd (Full Contour Design) and pre-oiled finish, installation is simple and ensures your engine breathes better while maintaining maximum protection. Vehicle Compatibility Ducati Hypermotard 698 Mono (2023-2026) Key Features of DNA Stage 2 Combo Filter Use: Race use only Box Includes: Air Filter \\u0026 Cover Design: DNA’s Advanced FCd (Full Contour Design) OEM Part Numbers: 42610751A FILTER, 8291R811A CASE, 24717531B COVER Filtering Efficiency: 98-99% (ISO 5011) with 4 layers of DNA Cotton Pre-Oiled: Supplied pre-oiled from the factory with exact DNA oil amount applied Airflow Increase: +161.40% over OEM DNA Air Filter Flow: 8600 liters/min @18.1 mBAR corrected @ 25°C OEM Air Filter Flow: 3290 liters/min @18.1 mBAR corrected @ 25°C Performance Highlights Extreme Airflow Increase: Boosts airflow by 161.40% for maximum engine performance and throttle response. High Filtration Efficiency: Protects your engine by capturing 98-99% of dirt, including fine particles, even in race conditions. Spark-Safe Design: Suitable for highly tuned race engines, reducing ignition risks. Easy Installation: Simply follow the instructions in the DNA packaging and workshop manual for fast and trouble-free installation. Stage 2 Combo Benefits: Includes both a high-flow air filter and cover to maximize intake airflow and performance. Airflow Comparison DNA Stage 2 Combo Flow: 8600 liters/min @18.1 mBAR corrected @ 25°C OEM Stock Filter Flow: 3290 liters/min @18.1 mBAR corrected @ 25°C Airflow Increase: +161.40% Applications This DNA Stage 2 Combo is designed exclusively for race use on the Ducati Hypermotard 698 Mono. It provides unmatched airflow, improved throttle response, and engine protection, making it ideal for high-performance racing conditions. Why Choose DNA Stage 2 Combo for Ducati Hypermotard? The DNA Stage 2 Combo features Full Contour Design (FCd) to eliminate dead spots in the airbox, optimize active filtering area, and reduce turbulence. With extreme airflow increase, pre-oiled convenience, and spark-safe construction, this Stage 2 kit is perfect for riders seeking maximum performance and reliability on the track. Order the DNA Stage 2 Air Filter \\u0026 Cover for Ducati Hypermotard Today! Upgrade your Ducati Hypermotard 698 Mono with the DNA Stage 2 Combo (P-DU65HM24-S2-COMBO) and experience extreme airflow, superior engine protection, and race-ready performance. Designed for high-flow, high-efficiency racing applications, this combo kit is ready to install and take your performance to the next level.91:T4d3,Compatibility Note: TRIDENT 660: YEAR 21\\u003e BMC air filters are produced using a \\\"Full Moulding\\\" system that enables the characteristic red filter to be realized from a single mold with no welded joints thus avoiding easy breakage. The rubber used in BMC air filtering systems has a long life, is very durable, and has optimum adhesion characteristics to all shapes of airboxes. BMC filters are made of multi-layered cotton gauze soaked with low viscosity oil covered with an epoxy coated alloy mesh to ensure protection from petrol fumes and oxidization due to air humidity. All BMC air filters are pre-oiled, and they can be washed and regenerated by using the appropriate BMC regeneration kit. Maximize the efficiency of the air entering your engine to maximize the power coming out of your engine. Keep your bike breathing and performing at its peak with BMC Air Filters! Features: BMC air filters ensure a higher air flow than original paper filters No modifications are required to install them Designed and produced by Italian engineers It can be used in extreme conditions Note: Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. Air filters do not qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements.92:T758,DNA Air Box Cover Stage 2 P-KT3N20-S2 for KTM RC 390 (2022–2023) Upgrade your KTM RC 390 with the DNA Stage 2 Air Box Cover (P-KT3N20-S2), engineered to dramatically improve airflow, throttle response, and overall engine performance.