. BMC air filters are produced using a \\\"Full Moulding\\\" system that enables the characteristic red filter to be realized from a single mold with no welded joints, thus avoiding easy breakage. The rubber used in BMC air filtering systems has a long life and is very durable, ensuring optimum adhesion characteristics to all shapes of airboxes. The BMC Air Filter for Car is an air filter replacement for your vehicle. It is constructed to be highly functional and help protect your car from dirt and contaminants, ensuring optimal performance. The BMC Air Filter is the ideal way to increase airflow while protecting your engine components by filtering out unwanted dirt and grime, prolonging their lifespan. Let your car breathe easy with the BMC Air Filter. Made from highly performing materials and a unique design, this air filter ensures containment of all impurities from as small as 7 microns. The filtering system is made of a multi-layered cotton gauze soaked with low-viscosity oil covered with an epoxy-coated alloy mesh to ensure protection from petrol fumes and oxidization due to air humidity. SPECIFICATIONS:- Type of Product Air Filter Width 234 mm Model No FB883/20 Country of Origin India Color Red Length 285 mm Washable Yes Compatibility VOLVO XC60 D4/D5 17\\u003e Shape Panel Filter Material Oiled Cotton Gauzea5:T8fa,BMC Air Filter for Royal Enfield Hunter 350 - FM01138 Upgrade your Royal Enfield Enfield Hunter 350 performance with the BMC Air Filter FM01138 — a high-quality, reusable air filtration solution engineered for optimal airflow and superior engine protection. Designed and manufactured in Italy with precision craftsmanship, the BMC Air Filter FM01138 replaces the original paper filter with an advanced oiled cotton gauze filter. This innovative design allows up to 18.5% greater airflow, enhancing engine efficiency and delivering noticeable performance gains while promoting fuel savings. Key Features: Enhanced Airflow \\u0026 Performance: The multi-layered cotton gauze filter provides superior breathability, allowing your engine to inhale more air, which improves combustion efficiency and overall power output. Superior Filtration Efficiency: Meets international ISO 5011 filtration standards with a 98.5% filtration efficiency, ensuring that harmful particles are effectively trapped, protecting your engine from wear and contaminants. Reusable \\u0026 Washable: Unlike conventional paper filters, the BMC filter can be cleaned and re-oiled with the BMC regeneration kit, extending its lifespan and reducing replacement costs. Durable Construction: Features a dual-layer aluminum frame with an epoxy coating for enhanced strength and resistance to corrosion, guaranteeing a precise fit and an airtight seal within the motorcycle’s airbox. Eco-Friendly Solution: The washable filter reduces environmental impact by minimizing waste from disposable filters. Easy Installation: Comes with comprehensive instructions, designed as a direct replacement for the OEM filter (part number 1570250). Technical Specifications: Filter Type: Oiled Cotton Gauze Dimensions: 51 mm (inner diameter) x 90 mm (outer diameter) x 104 mm (height) Warranty: 2 years limited Weight: 0.26 kg Compatibility: Royal Enfield Meteor 350 (2021 and later) Royal Enfield Bullet 350 (2023 and later) Royal Enfield Classic Reborn 350 (2022 and later) Royal Enfield Hunter 350 (2022 and later) Experience the perfect blend of Italian engineering, environmental responsibility, and enhanced motorcycle performance with the BMC Air Filter FM01138 — the premium choice for Royal Enfield enthusiasts seeking reliable power and longevity.a6:T8f4,BMC Air Filter FM01138 for Royal Enfield Meteor 350 Upgrade your Royal Enfield Meteor 350’s performance with the BMC Air Filter FM01138 — a high-quality, reusable air filtration solution engineered for optimal airflow and superior engine protection. Designed and manufactured in Italy with precision craftsmanship, the BMC Air Filter FM01138 rep