rtant to note that while cotton gauze filters offer these advantages, proper maintenance is necessary to ensure optimal performance. Regular cleaning and reoiling according to the manufacturer's instructions are essential to maintain the filter's effectiveness. Benefits of using our filters Factory Pre-Oiled Air Filters Increased Throttle response Direct stock replacement Optimum filtering efficiency Designed with support pillars for the best durability Extensively tested on all Terrains Eco-Friendly product.af:T7b4,BMC Air Filter for BAJAJ PULSAR NS 400 Z 2024 - FM01239 Upgrade your BAJAJ Pulsar NS 400 Z 2024 with the high-performance BMC Air Filter, designed to enhance engine efficiency, improve airflow, and provide optimal performance. Engineered for superior filtration and durability, this air filter ensures your motorcycle’s engine breathes easier, resulting in improved acceleration, throttle response, and fuel efficiency. Key Features: Enhanced Airflow: BMC’s advanced filtration technology allows for increased airflow, which optimizes engine performance and provides better acceleration. High-Quality Materials: Constructed with premium materials for maximum filtration and longevity, offering superior dust and debris protection. Improved Fuel Efficiency: With better airflow, the engine operates more efficiently, leading to improved fuel efficiency and smoother rides. Durable \\u0026 Long-Lasting: The BMC Air Filter is designed for long-term use, with a high resistance to wear and tear, ensuring lasting protection for your engine. Easy Maintenance: The reusable design of the BMC Air Filter ensures that cleaning and maintaining it is simple, providing long-term cost savings. Direct Fit: This air filter is specifically designed for the BAJAJ Pulsar NS 400 Z 2024, ensuring easy installation and a perfect fit. Why Choose the BMC Air Filter? The BMC Air Filter is a must-have upgrade for your BAJAJ Pulsar NS 400 Z 2024. With its ability to improve engine performance, fuel efficiency, and overall ride quality, it’s the ideal choice for riders looking to get the most out of their motorcycle. Trust in BMC’s reputation for producing high-performance air filters that are trusted by riders worldwide. Upgrade Your Bike's Performance Today Don't settle for less. Upgrade your BAJAJ Pulsar NS 400 Z 2024 with the BMC Air Filter and experience improved performance, better fuel efficiency, and smoother riding. Order now and ensure your motorcycle runs at its best!b0:T4ec,Compatibility Note: ROYAL ENFIELD CONTINENTAL GT 650: YEAR 19\\u003e INTERCEPTOR 650: YEAR 19\\u003e BMC air filters are produced using a \\\"Full Moulding\\\" system that enables the characteristic red filter to be realized from a single mold with no welded joints thus avoiding easy breakage. The rubber used in BMC air filtering systems has a long life, is very durable, and has optimum adhesion characteristics to all shapes of airboxes. BMC filters are made of a multi-layered cotton gauze soaked with low-viscosity oil covered with an epoxy-coated alloy mesh to ensure protection from petrol fumes and oxidization due to air humidity. All BMC air filters are pre-oiled and can be washed and regenerated using the appropriate BMC regeneration kit. Maximize the efficiency of the air entering your engine to maximize the power coming out. Keep your bike breathing and performing at its peak with BMC Air Filters! Features: BMC air filters ensure a higher air flow than original paper filters No modifications are required to install them Designed and produced by Italian engineers It can be used in extreme conditions Note: Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. Air filters do not qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements.b1:T513,Compatibility Note: PULSAR AS 200 : YEAR 15\\u003e16 PULSAR NS 200 : YEAR 12\\u003e16 PULSAR NS 200 BSIV : YEAR 17\\u003e18 BMC air filters are produced using a \\\"Full Moulding\\\" system that enables the charact