"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Browse our exclusive collection of Air Filters on Irani MotoHub.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1012/0619/6541/collections/air-filter-bike.png?v=1787078101\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"Air Filters\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Irani MotoHub | Premium Motorcycle Performance Parts\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Premium Motorcycle accessories and performance upgrades\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://iranimotohub.in/hero-bg.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"12\",{\"rel\":\"shortcut icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"13\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?favicon.1-ypg-tqme8hc.ico\",\"sizes\":\"1024x1024\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"14\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"15\",{\"rel\":\"apple-touch-icon\",\"href\":\"/imhlogo.png\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2c\",\"16\",{}]]\n2d:I[12371,[\"/_next/static/chunks/2wh3bu9ub4p8d.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/2bmv3ihep17gq.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3cichi1mg1ftc.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3whgfyvaz15fw.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0q6ibp_bkaa1-.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3j-4ruzks89pv.js\"],\"default\"]\n2e:T8af,BMC Air filter for RE Guerrilla 450 - FM01210 Unleash the true potential of your Royal Enfield Himalayan 450 or Guerrilla 450 with the BMC Air Filter FM01210 — a high-performance, washable filter engineered for optimal airflow, superior filtration, and long-lasting durability. Crafted in Italy to meet the highest standards of quality and precision, the BMC FM01210 air filter replaces the OEM paper filter with a high-flow, oiled cotton gauze alternative. Ideal for both everyday use and demanding off-road conditions, this cylindrical air filter enhances engine efficiency and longevity by improving air intake while offering exceptional particle filtration. Key Features: Optimized Engine Breathing: Allows significantly improved airflow compared to stock filters, enabling better combustion, throttle response, and power delivery. Superior Filtration Efficiency: Constructed with multi-layered oiled cotton gauze, this filter efficiently captures impurities larger than 7 microns. Tested to meet ISO 5011 standards with up to 97.5% filtration efficiency. Reusable & Eco-Friendly: Fully washable and reusable using BMC’s regeneration kit (sold separately). A sustainable and cost-effective alternative to disposable filters. Durable Italian Engineering: Built with a strong, epoxy-coated aluminum mesh for structural integrity, even under high temperature and humidity conditions. Ensures a perfect seal within the airbox. Technical Specifications: Filter Shape: Cylindrical Filter Material: Oiled Cotton Gauze Washable: Yes Warranty: 2 Years Limited EAN: 8053435270663 Dimensions: Base Inner Diameter: 120 mm Base Outer Diameter: 145 mm Height: 105 mm Packaging: Box Dimensions (W x L x H): 105 x 120 x 145 mm Gross Weight: 0.50 kg Package Contents: 1 Air Filter Vehicle Compatibility: Royal Enfield Himalayan 450 (2024 onwards) Royal Enfield Guerrilla 450 (2024 onwards) Built for Adventure, Designed for Performance Whether you're conquering rugged trails or cruising the open road, the BMC FM01210 air filter ensures your Himalayan 450 or Guerrilla 450 performs at its peak — mile after mile. Experience cleaner air, better throttle response, and the reliability trusted by motorsport professionals worldwide.2f:T599,Compatibility Note: KTM 125 GEN 3 DUKE YEAR 2024> 250 GEN 3 DUKE YEAR 2024> 390 GEN 3 DUKE YEAR 2024> HUSQVARNA SVARTPILEN 125 YEAR 2024> SVARTPILEN 250 YEAR 2024> SVARTPILEN 401 YEAR 2024> VITPILEN 125 YEAR 2024> VITPILEN 401 YEAR 2024> BMC air filters are produced using a \"Full Moulding\" system that enables the characteristic red filter to be realized from a single mould with no welded joints thus avoiding easy breakage. The rubber used in BMC air filtering systems has a long life, is very durable and has optimum adhesion characteristics to all shapes of airboxes. BMC filters are made of a multi-layered cotton gauze soaked with low viscosity oil covered with an epoxy coated alloy mesh to ensure protection from petrol fumes and oxidization due to air humidity. All BMC air filters are pre-oiled, and they can be washed and regenerated by using the appropriate BMC regeneration kit. Maximize the efficiency of the air entering your engine to maximize the power coming out of your engine. Keep your bike breathing and performing at its peak with BMC Air Filters! Features: BMC air filters ensure a higher air flow than original paper filters No modifications are required to install them Designed and produced by Italian engineers It can be used in extreme conditions Note: Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. Air filters do not qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements.30:T8c4,BMC Replacement Air Filter FM01210 for Royal Enfield Himalayan 450 Unleash the true potential of your Royal Enfield Himalayan 450 or Guerrilla 450 with the BMC Air Filter FM01210 — a high-performance, washable filter engineered for optimal airflow, superior filtration, and long-lasting durability. Crafted in Italy to meet the highest standards of quality and precision, the BMC FM01210 air filter replaces the OEM paper filter with a high-flow, oiled cotton gauze alternative. Ideal for both everyday use and demanding off-road conditions, this cylindrical air filter enhances engine efficiency and longevity by improving air intake while offering exceptional particle filtration. Key Features: Optimized Engine Breathing: Allows significantly improved airflow compared to stock filters, enabling better combustion, throttle response, and power delivery. Superior Filtration Efficiency: Constructed with multi-layered oiled cotton gauze, this filter efficiently captures impurities larger than 7 microns. Tested to meet ISO 5011 standards with up to 97.5% filtration efficiency. Reusable & Eco-Friendly: Fully washable and reusable using BMC’s regeneration kit (sold separately). A sustainable and cost-effective alternative to disposable filters. Durable Italian Engineering: Built with a strong, epoxy-coated aluminum mesh for structural integrity, even under high temperature and humidity conditions. Ensures a perfect seal within the airbox. Technical Specifications: Filter Shape: Cylindrical Filter Material: Oiled Cotton Gauze Washable: Yes Warranty: 2 Years Limited EAN: 8053435270663 Dimensions: Base Inner Diameter: 120 mm Base Outer Diameter: 145 mm Height: 105 mm Packaging: Box Dimensions (W x L x H): 105 x 120 x 145 mm Gross Weight: 0.50 kg Package Contents: 1 Air Filter Vehicle Compatibility: Royal Enfield Himalayan 450 (2024 onwards) Royal Enfield Guerrilla 450 (2024 onwards) Built for Adventure, Designed for Performance Whether you're conquering rugged trails or cruising the open road, the BMC FM01210 air filter ensures your Himalayan 450 or Guerrilla 450 performs at its peak — mile after mile. Experience cleaner air, better throttle response, and the reliability trusted by motorsport professionals worldwide.31:T52b,Compatibility Note: DL 1000 V-STROM: YEAR 14 > DL 1000 V-STROM: YEAR 14> DL 1000 V-STROM: YEAR 14>19 DL 1050 V-STROM XT: YEAR 20> BMC air filters are produced using a \"Full Moulding\" system that enables the characteristic red filter to be realized from a single mold with no welded joints thus avoiding easy breakage. The rubber used in BMC air filtering systems has a long life, is very durable, and has optimum adhesion characteristics to all shapes of airboxes. BMC filters are made of multi-layered cotton gauze soaked with low viscosity oil covered with an epoxy coated alloy mesh to ensure protection from petrol fumes and oxidization due to air humidity. All BMC air filters are pre-oiled, and they can be washed and regenerated by using the appropriate BMC regeneration kit. Maximize the efficiency of the air entering your engine to maximize the power coming out of your engine. Keep your bike breathing and performing at its peak with BMC Air Filters! Features: BMC air filters ensure a higher air flow than original paper filters No modifications are required to install them Designed and produced by Italian engineers It can be used in extreme conditions Note: Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. Air filters do not qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements.32:T529,Compatibility Note: F 750 GS: YEAR 18>19 F 850 GS: YEAR 18>19 F 850 GS ADVENTURE: YEAR 19> F 900 R: YEAR >20 F 900 XR: YEAR >20 BMC air filters are produced using a \"Full Moulding\" system that enables the characteristic red filter to be realized from a single mold with no welded joints thus avoiding easy breakage. The rubber used in BMC air filtering systems has a long life, is very durable, and has optimum adhesion characteristics to all shapes of airboxes. BMC filters are made of multi-layered cotton gauze soaked with low viscosity oil covered with an epoxy coated alloy mesh to ensure protection from petrol fumes and oxidization due to air humidity. All BMC air filters are pre-oiled, and they can be washed and regenerated by using the appropriate BMC regeneration kit. Maximize the efficiency of the air entering your engine to maximize the power coming out of your engine. Keep your bike breathing and performing at its peak with BMC Air Filters! Features: BMC air filters ensure a higher air flow than original paper filters No modifications are required to install them Designed and produced by Italian engineers It can be used in extreme conditions Note: Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. Air filters do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements.33:T515,Compatibility Note: CRF 1100 L AFRICA TWIN: YEAR 20> CRF 1100 L AFRICA TWIN ADVENTURE / SPORT: YEAR 20> BMC air filters are produced using a \"Full Moulding\" system that enables the characteristic red filter to be realized from a single mold with no welded joints thus avoiding easy breakage. The rubber used in BMC air filtering systems has a long life, is very durable, and has optimum adhesion characteristics to all shapes of airboxes. BMC filters are made of multi-layered cotton gauze soaked with low viscosity oil covered with an epoxy coated alloy mesh to ensure protection from petrol fumes and oxidization due to air humidity. All BMC air filters are pre-oiled, and they can be washed and regenerated by using the appropriate BMC regeneration kit. Maximize the efficiency of the air entering your engine to maximize the power coming out of your engine. Keep your bike breathing and performing at its peak with BMC Air Filters! Features: BMC air filters ensure a higher air flow than original paper filters. No modifications are required to install them. Designed and produced by Italian engineers. It can be used in extreme conditions. Note: Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. Air filters do NOT qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements.34:Ta51,Street: allowing a greater flow of 18.5% compared to paper filter. Advantage: In some cases it allows saving of gasoline. Performance increase. Regenerate the air filter also allows less air pollution, given that there are no waste materials. Saving money ... the filter is regenerated. This accessory is designed to replace the original drive. The kit comes with installation instructions, and in any case it can refer to the book \"operation and maintenance\". Importance of the air filter The air filter is a device whose purpose is to purify the air from the suspended solid particles, like powders and is used to \"purify\" the air entering the combustion chamber of internal combustion engines, avoiding contamination of the air/fuel mixture. Italian quality for BMC air filters BMC air filters consist of a structure formed in two layers of aluminum protected by an epoxy coating that contains the cotton filter material arranged on several layers. The extreme constructive care, and the use of first choice materials allow a minimum loss of load, that is the difference that is created between air to be filtered and filtered air. Efficiency and perfect seal The filtering cotton gauze is moistened with oil to collect and filter even the smallest impurities, this guarantees a higher filter performance and an optimal air quality for the engine of any motorcycle. The filter element is printed inside an external frame that allows a precise, easy and efficient installation with a perfect seal inside the motorcycle Air-box. The processing, from the design to the production of the air filter are entirely carried out in Italy by qualified Italian technicians. ECOLOGICAL AND ECONOMIC BMC air filters are made of natural and ecological fabric,the cotton, this allows a deep cleaning and a regeneration of the air filter, unlike the original ones in paper, at the end of the life cycle should be discarded and new repurchased. With the BMC KIT (Purchasable by clicking >here<) composed of detergent and oil, it is possible to clean and re-oil the filter bringing it to the original conditions. An operation that must be carried out every 15 / 20,000 km, avoiding the purchase of a new filter, thus also reducing waste for the environment.98785 Outside Width/Base Inner Diameter (mm) : 88 Outside Length/Base Outside Diameter (mm) : 224 Filter Material : Oiled Cotton Gauze Washable : Yes Warranty : 2 Years Limited EAN : 805732598785 Product Box Width (mm) : 160 Product Box Length (mm) : 237 Product Box Height (mm) : 38 Gross Weight (Kg) : 0,3 Package Quantity : 1 Package Contents : 1 Air Filter OEM Cross Reference: HERO 17208ABW000S35:T8f4,BMC Air Filter for Classic Reborn 350 - FM01138 Upgrade your Royal Enfield Classic Reborn 350 performance with the BMC Air Filter FM01138 — a high-quality, reusable air filtration solution engineered for optimal airflow and superior engine protection. Designed and manufactured in Italy with precision craftsmanship, the BMC Air Filter FM01138 replaces the original paper filter with an advanced oiled cotton gauze filter. This innovative design allows up to 18.5% greater airflow, enhancing engine efficiency and delivering noticeable performance gains while promoting fuel savings. Key Features: Enhanced Airflow & Performance: The multi-layered cotton gauze filter provides superior breathability, allowing your engine to inhale more air, which improves combustion efficiency and overall power output. Superior Filtration Efficiency: Meets international ISO 5011 filtration standards with a 98.5% filtration efficiency, ensuring that harmful particles are effectively trapped, protecting your engine from wear and contaminants. Reusable & Washable: Unlike conventional paper filters, the BMC filter can be cleaned and re-oiled with the BMC regeneration kit, extending its lifespan and reducing replacement costs. Durable Construction: Features a dual-layer aluminum frame with an epoxy coating for enhanced strength and resistance to corrosion, guaranteeing a precise fit and an airtight seal within the motorcycle’s airbox. Eco-Friendly Solution: The washable filter reduces environmental impact by minimizing waste from disposable filters. Easy Installation: Comes with comprehensive instructions, designed as a direct replacement for the OEM filter (part number 1570250). Technical Specifications: Filter Type: Oiled Cotton Gauze Dimensions: 51 mm (inner diameter) x 90 mm (outer diameter) x 104 mm (height) Warranty: 2 years limited Weight: 0.26 kg Compatibility: Royal Enfield Meteor 350 (2021 and later) Royal Enfield Bullet 350 (2023 and later) Royal Enfield Classic Reborn 350 (2022 and later) Royal Enfield Hunter 350 (2022 and later) Experience the perfect blend of Italian engineering, environmental responsibility, and enhanced motorcycle performance with the BMC Air Filter FM01138 — the premium choice for Royal Enfield enthusiasts seeking reliable power and longevity.36:T7cd,DNA High Performance Air Filter P-KT3N24-01 for KTM Duke 390 (2024) Upgrade your KTM Duke 390 (2024) with the DNA High Performance Air Filter P-KT3N24-01, engineered to boost horsepower, acceleration, and engine efficiency. Ideal for road, off-road, and race applications, this drop-in filter delivers high-flow performance while maintaining exceptional filtration. Key Features & Technical Specifications Filter Use: Road, Off-Road & Race Vehicle Compatibility: KTM Duke 390 (2024) Filter Type: High Flow Reusable Air Filter Filter Design: DNA Advanced FCd (Full Contour Design) Filtering Material: 4 Layers of Premium DNA® Cotton Gauze Filtering Efficiency: 98% – 99% (ISO 5011 Certified) Pre-Oiled: Factory pre-oiled for immediate installation Sealing: High-quality EVA seal for a perfect airtight fit Supporting Frame: Laser-cut embedded frame for durability and stability Performance Comparison (Air Flow) Specification DNA Air Filter OEM Stock Filter Air Flow @ 1.5” H2O 102.70 CFM 72.53 CFM Increase in Air Flow +41.60% — Filtering Efficiency 98–99% — Testing Conditions @ 25°C, 1.5” H2O @ 25°C, 1.5” H2O Reusability & Maintenance Washable & Reusable: Yes Cleaning Interval: Every 10,000–15,000 km (under standard conditions) Long-Term Value: Designed to last the life of your vehicle Dimensions Length: 37 cmWidth: 24 cmHeight: 7 cm Advantages Summary +41.60% More Airflow Than OEM Filter High Filtration Efficiency (98–99%) for Optimal Engine Protection Reusable & Washable for Long-Term Cost Savings Easy Drop-In Installation with OEM Fitment Enhanced Performance for Road, Off-Road, and Race Use Lifetime Warranty from DNA for Quality Assurance Final Verdict The DNA Air Filter P-KT3N24-01 is the ultimate performance upgrade for KTM Duke 390 (2024) riders seeking enhanced horsepower, improved throttle response, and superior engine protection. With its high-flow, reusable design and advanced FCd construction, it’s a must-have for enthusiasts and racers alike.37:T695,Compatibility Note: F 650 GS 2008 > 2015 F 700 GS 2012 > F 800 GS 2008 > F 800 GS ADVENTURE 2013 > NUDA 900 2012 > 2013 NUDA 900 R 2012 > 2013 The panel air filter is commonly referred to as a \"replacement air filter\". It is installed in the vehicle's original airbox to replace the OEM air filter. It is made of highly performing materials that allow an increased air flow combined with a more efficient filtration, guaranteeing containment of all impurities from as small as 7 microns (compared to OEM's 10 microns). BMC air filters are produced using a \"Full Moulding\" system that enables the characteristic red filter to be realized from a single mold with no welded joints thus avoiding easy breakage. The rubber used in BMC air filtering systems has a long life, is very durable, and has optimum adhesion characteristics to all shapes of airboxes. BMC filters are made of a multi-layered cotton gauze soaked with low-viscosity oil covered with an epoxy-coated alloy mesh to ensure protection from petrol fumes and oxidization due to air humidity. All BMC air filters are pre-oiled, and they can be washed and regenerated by using the appropriate BMC regeneration kit. Features: Outside Width/Base Outside Diameter (mm) 92 Outside Length/Base Inner Diameter (mm) 152 General Info Filter Material Oiled Cotton Gauze Washable Yes Warranty 2 Years Limited Product Box Info Product Box Width (mm) 38 Product Box Length (mm) 160 Product Box Height (mm) 237 Gross Weight (Kg) 0.32 Package Quantity 1 Package Contents 1 Air Filter Note: Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. Air filters do not qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements.38:T53b,Compatibility Note: S 1000 R: YEAR 14>20 S 1000 RR: YEAR 09>18 S 1000 RR HP4 : YEAR 11>14 S 1000 RR HP4 RACE : YEAR 17>18 S 1000 XR: YEAR 15>19 BMC air filters are produced using a \"Full Moulding\" system that enables the characteristic red filter to be realized from a single mold with no welded joints thus avoiding easy breakage. The rubber used in BMC air filtering systems has a long life, is very durable, and has optimum adhesion characteristics to all shapes of airboxes. BMC filters are made of a multi-layered cotton gauze soaked with low-viscosity oil covered with an epoxy-coated alloy mesh to ensure protection from petrol fumes and oxidization due to air humidity. All BMC air filters are pre-oiled, and they can be washed and regenerated by using the appropriate BMC regeneration kit. Maximize the efficiency of the air entering your engine to maximize the power coming out of your engine. Keep your bike breathing and performing at its peak with BMC Air Filters! Features: BMC air filters ensure a higher air flow than original paper filters No modifications are required to install them Designed and produced by Italian engineers It can be used in extreme conditions Note: Refer to your vehicle's user manual for more details before placing the orders. Air filters do not qualify for any exchange, returns, or replacements.39:T53b,Compatibility Note: S 1000 R: YEAR 14>20 S 1000 RR: YEAR 09>18 S 1000 RR HP4 : YEAR 11>14 S 1000 RR HP4 RACE : YEAR 17>18 S 1000 XR: YEAR 15>19 BMC air filters are produced using a \"Full Moulding\" system that enables the characteristic red filter to be realized from a single mold with no welded joints thus avoiding easy breakage. The rubber used in BMC air filtering systems has a long life, is very durable, and has optimum adhesion characteristics to all shapes of airboxes. BMC filters are made of a multi-layered cotton gauze soaked with low-viscosity oil covered with an epoxy-coated alloy mesh to ensure protectio