ip, the BMC Air Filter FM01138 replaces the original paper filter with an advanced oiled cotton gauze filter. This innovative design allows up to 18.5% greater airflow, enhancing engine efficiency and delivering noticeable performance gains while promoting fuel savings. Key Features: Enhanced Airflow & Performance: The multi-layered cotton gauze filter provides superior breathability, allowing your engine to inhale more air, which improves combustion efficiency and overall power output. Superior Filtration Efficiency: Meets international ISO 5011 filtration standards with a 98.5% filtration efficiency, ensuring that harmful particles are effectively trapped, protecting your engine from wear and contaminants. Reusable & Washable: Unlike conventional paper filters, the BMC filter can be cleaned and re-oiled with the BMC regeneration kit, extending its lifespan and reducing replacement costs. Durable Construction: Features a dual-layer aluminum frame with an epoxy coating for enhanced strength and resistance to corrosion, guaranteeing a precise fit and an airtight seal within the motorcycle’s airbox. Eco-Friendly Solution: The washable filter reduces environmental impact by minimizing waste from disposable filters. Easy Installation: Comes with comprehensive instructions, designed as a direct replacement for the OEM filter (part number 1570250). Technical Specifications: Filter Type: Oiled Cotton Gauze Dimensions: 51 mm (inner diameter) x 90 mm (outer diameter) x 104 mm (height) Warranty: 2 years limited Weight: 0.26 kg Compatibility: Royal Enfield Meteor 350 (2021 and later) Royal Enfield Bullet 350 (2023 and later) Royal Enfield Classic Reborn 350 (2022 and later) Royal Enfield Hunter 350 (2022 and later) Experience the perfect blend of Italian engineering, environmental responsibility, and enhanced motorcycle performance with the BMC Air Filter FM01138 — the premium choice for Royal Enfield enthusiasts seeking reliable power and longevity.a6:T8f4,BMC Air Filter FM01